
---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="Applied AI & Robotics Systems Engineer"
  description="Naveen Rajan builds computer vision, edge ML, and autonomous robotics systems, and develops reproducible scientific machine learning tools."
>
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="hero-eyebrow">
      <span class="status-dot"></span>
      <span>COMPUTER VISION</span>
      <span class="eyebrow-separator">/</span>
      <span>EDGE ML</span>
      <span class="eyebrow-separator">/</span>
      <span>SCIENTIFIC ML</span>
    </div>

    <div class="hero-stage">
      <div class="hero-content">
        <p class="hero-kicker">ENGINEERING INTELLIGENT SYSTEMS</p>

        <h1>
          Applied AI &amp;
          <span>Systems Engineer</span>
        </h1>

        <p class="intro">
          I build perception and autonomy systems that work under real-world
          constraints — combining computer vision, edge ML, and reliable
          real-time software.
        </p>

        <p class="hero-secondary">
          Also building reproducible scientific ML tools and exploring
          physics-informed neural networks.
        </p>

        <div class="hero-actions">
          <a class="button-primary" href="#selected-work">
            Explore my work <span aria-hidden="true">↘</span>
          </a>
          <a class="button-secondary" href="mailto:hello@navrjn.com">
            Get in touch <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
          </a>
        </div>

        <div class="hero-meta">
          <span class="location-dot"></span>
          Vienna, Austria
          <span class="meta-divider">·</span>
          Open to engineering opportunities
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="hero-image">
        <img
          src="/images/me-1.webp"
          alt="Portrait of Naveen Rajan"
          class="portrait"
          fetchpriority="high"
        />
        <div class="image-caption">
          <span>NAVEEN RAJAN</span>
          <span>ENGINEER · BUILDER</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="now-section" aria-labelledby="now-heading">
    <div class="section-label" id="now-heading">
      <span>01</span>
      WHAT I'M FOCUSED ON
    </div>

    <div class="now-grid">
      <article class="now-item">
        <span class="now-index">01 / BUILDING</span>
        <h2>Knowledge graph suite - Legal</h2>
        <p>
            A suite of tools that helps legal teams understand entity relations in large unstructured corpora
        </p>
      </article>

      <article class="now-item">
        <span class="now-index">02 / EXPLORING</span>
        <h2>Perception &amp; autonomy</h2>
        <p>
          Reliable visual perception, sensor fusion, and intelligent
          systems operating on constrained hardware.
        </p>
      </article>

      <article class="now-item">
        <span class="now-index">03 / RESEARCHING </span>
        <h2>Physics Informed Neural Networks</h2>
        <p>
          Studying latent-space manifolds for solving under-determined family of industrial simulations with single PINN models
        </p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="content-section" id="selected-work">
    <div class="section-heading">
      <div>
        <div class="section-label">
          <span>02</span>
          SELECTED WORK
        </div>
        <h2 class="section-title">Built, tested, learned.</h2>
      </div>

      <a class="section-link" href="/projects">
        All projects <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
      </a>
    </div>

    <div class="projects">
      <a class="project project-featured" href="/projects">
        <div class="project-topline">
          <span class="project-type">ROBOTICS · EDGE ML</span>
          <span class="project-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
        </div>

        <h3>Autonomous perception &amp; navigation</h3>

        <p>
          Led perception and navigation systems for a drone platform,
          combining classical computer vision, monocular depth, Deep learning, sensor
          fusion, and recovery policies for GPS-denied operation.
        </p>

        <div class="project-result">
          <strong>97%</strong>
          <span>
            reported navigation robustness after recovery-policy
            improvements
          </span>
        </div>

        <div class="project-footer">
          <span>Flying4Home / ClearBee</span>
          <span>2021 — Present</span>
        </div>
      </a>

      <a
        class="project"
        href="https://github.com/NavRjn/PINN-Thesis"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noreferrer"
      >
        <div class="project-topline">
          <span class="project-type">SCIENTIFIC ML</span>
          <span class="project-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
        </div>

        <h3>PINN research framework</h3>

        <p>
          A configurable experimentation framework for physics-informed
          neural networks, with reusable problem abstractions, CLI
          orchestration, and reproducible training workflows.
        </p>

        <div class="project-tags">
          <span>Python</span>
          <span>PyTorch</span>
          <span>Numerical methods</span>
        </div>

        <div class="project-footer">
          <span>Research tooling</span>
          <span>2025 — Present</span>
        </div>
      </a>

      <a
        class="project"
        href="https://github.com/NavRjn/entity-resolution"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noreferrer"
      >
        <div class="project-topline">
          <span class="project-type">APPLIED AI</span>
          <span class="project-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
        </div>

        <h3>Entity resolution</h3>

        <p>
          An AI-assisted document processing project exploring entity
          extraction, normalization, evaluation, and reviewable
          structured outputs.
        </p>

        <div class="project-tags">
          <span>Information extraction</span>
          <span>Evaluation</span>
        </div>

        <div class="project-footer">
          <span>Software project</span>
          <span>View repository</span>
        </div>
      </a>
    </div>

    <p class="project-note">
      The navigation case study is being documented separately.
      Repository links above open the corresponding public projects.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="writing-section">
    <div class="writing-copy">
      <div class="section-label">
        <span>03</span>
        WRITING &amp; RESEARCH NOTES
      </div>

      <h2>Understanding systems by building them.</h2>

      <p>
        Notes on engineering reliable perception pipelines, running
        reproducible scientific ML experiments, and the trade-offs
        behind building intelligent systems that work outside a demo.
      </p>
    </div>

    <a class="writing-link" href="/writing">
      Explore writing <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
    </a>
  </section>

  <section class="contact-section">
    <div>
      <div class="section-label">
        <span>04</span>
        GET IN TOUCH
      </div>

      <h2>Have an interesting problem?</h2>

      <p>
        I'm interested in applied AI, computer vision, robotics, and
        engineering teams building technically ambitious products.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="contact-actions">
      <a href="mailto:hello@navrjn.com">Email me ↗</a>
      <a
        href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/navrjn"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noreferrer"
      >
        LinkedIn ↗
      </a>
      <a
        href="https://github.com/navrjn"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noreferrer"
      >
        GitHub ↗
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
  .hero {
    padding-top: 36px;
  }

  .hero-eyebrow,
  .section-label,
  .hero-kicker,
  .now-index,
  .project-type {
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.13em;
  }

  .hero-eyebrow {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 11px;
    color: #c0c0c4;
    font-size: 13px;
    letter-spacing: 0.09em;
  }

  .status-dot,
  .location-dot {
    display: inline-block;
    flex: 0 0 auto;
    width: 7px;
    height: 7px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: #b4c9a9;
  }

  .eyebrow-separator {
    color: #505056;
  }

  .hero-stage {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.12fr) minmax(0, 0.88fr);
    align-items: center;
    position: relative;
    min-height: 590px;
    margin-top: 22px;
    padding: 24px 0 48px;
    isolation: isolate;
  }

  .hero-image {
    grid-column: 2;
    grid-row: 1;
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
    width: 100%;
    height: clamp(420px, 49vw, 560px);
    overflow: hidden;
    border: 1px solid #29292d;
    border-radius: 5px;
    background: #171719;
  }

  .portrait {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
    object-position: center 35%;
    filter: saturate(0.78);
  }

  .hero-image::after {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    pointer-events: none;
    background: linear-gradient(
      180deg,
      transparent 65%,
      rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.52) 100%
    );
  }

  .image-caption {
    position: absolute;
    z-index: 2;
    bottom: 18px;
    left: 20px;
    right: 20px;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 12px;
    color: #e4e4e4;
    font-size: 10px;
    letter-spacing: 0.11em;
  }

  .hero-content {
    grid-column: 1 / -1;
    grid-row: 1;
    position: relative;
    z-index: 2;
    width: min(760px, 72%);
    margin-right: auto;
    padding: clamp(28px, 4.5vw, 52px);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12);
    border-radius: 5px;
    background: rgba(15, 15, 17, 0.84);
    -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(22px) saturate(115%);
    backdrop-filter: blur(22px) saturate(115%);
    box-shadow: 0 22px 70px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.18);
  }

  .hero-kicker {
    margin: 0 0 23px;
    color: #b4c9a9;
    font-size: 11px;
  }

  h1 {
    max-width: 720px;
    margin: 0;
    font-size: clamp(44px, 5.5vw, 72px);
    font-weight: 620;
    line-height: 1.02;
    letter-spacing: -0.065em;
  }

  h1 span {
    display: block;
    margin-top: 5px;
    color: #929298;
  }

  .intro {
    max-width: 520px;
    margin: 26px 0 0;
    color: #e0e0e2;
    font-size: clamp(17px, 1.55vw, 19px);
    line-height: 1.65;
    letter-spacing: -0.015em;
  }

  .hero-secondary {
    max-width: 480px;
    margin: 12px 0 0;
    color: #96969c;
    font-size: 14px;
    line-height: 1.75;
  }

  .hero-actions {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 12px;
    margin-top: 29px;
  }

  .button-primary,
  .button-secondary {
    display: inline-flex;
    min-height: 44px;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 16px;
    padding: 10px 15px;
    border: 1px solid #414146;
    border-radius: 3px;
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 550;
    transition:
      background 160ms ease,
      border-color 160ms ease,
      color 160ms ease;
  }

  .button-primary {
    background: #e3e7df;
    border-color: #e3e7df;
    color: #141515;
  }

  .button-primary:hover {
    background: #fff;
    border-color: #fff;
    color: #111;
  }

  .button-secondary {
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.025);
    color: #e5e5e7;
  }

  .button-secondary:hover {
    border-color: #88888e;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.07);
  }

  .hero-meta {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 9px;
    margin-top: 28px;
    color: #a1a1a6;
    font-size: 12px;
  }

  .location-dot {
    width: 6px;
    height: 6px;
  }

  .meta-divider {
    color: #55555a;
  }

  .section-label {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 14px;
    color: #a0a0a5;
    font-size: 11px;
  }

  .section-label > span {
    color: #b4c9a9;
    font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
  }

  .now-section {
    margin-top: 14px;
    padding: 30px 0 34px;
    border-top: 1px solid #29292d;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #29292d;
  }

  .now-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 38px;
    margin-top: 28px;
  }

  .now-index {
    color: #74747b;
    font-size: 10px;
    letter-spacing: 0.11em;
  }

  .now-item h2 {
    margin: 10px 0 7px;
    font-size: 18px;
    font-weight: 560;
    letter-spacing: -0.035em;
  }

  .now-item p {
    max-width: 310px;
    margin: 0;
    color: #9a9aa0;
    font-size: 14px;
    line-height: 1.8;
  }

  .content-section {
    margin-top: 96px;
  }

  .section-heading {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-end;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 24px;
    margin-bottom: 28px;
  }

  .section-title {
    margin: 12px 0 0;
    font-size: clamp(27px, 3.5vw, 38px);
    font-weight: 570;
    line-height: 1.15;
    letter-spacing: -0.05em;
  }

  .section-link {
    flex-shrink: 0;
    padding-bottom: 4px;
    color: #b7b7bc;
    font-size: 13px;
  }

  .section-link:hover {
    color: #fff;
  }

  .projects {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 14px;
  }

  .project {
    display: flex;
    min-width: 0;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: stretch;
    padding: 25px;
    border: 1px solid #29292d;
    border-radius: 4px;
    background: #101012;
    transition:
      border-color 180ms ease,
      background 180ms ease,
      transform 180ms ease;
  }

  .project:hover {
    border-color: #515157;
    background: #141416;
    transform: translateY(-2px);
  }

  .project-featured {
    grid-column: 1 / -1;
    padding: 29px;
    background:
      radial-gradient(
        ellipse at 100% 0%,
        rgba(180, 201, 169, 0.065),
        transparent 55%
      ),
      #101012;
  }

  .project-topline,
  .project-footer {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 16px;
  }

  .project-type {
    color: #a6a6ac;
    font-size: 10px;
  }

  .project-arrow {
    color: #8c8c92;
    font-size: 18px;
    transition: transform 160ms ease;
  }

  .project:hover .project-arrow {
    transform: translate(2px, -2px);
    color: #fff;
  }

  .project h3 {
    margin: 24px 0 10px;
    color: #ededed;
    font-size: clamp(19px, 2vw, 23px);
    font-weight: 570;
    line-height: 1.3;
    letter-spacing: -0.035em;
  }

  .project p {
    max-width: 690px;
    margin: 0;
    color: #a1a1a7;
    font-size: 14px;
    line-height: 1.8;
  }

  .project-result {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 16px;
    margin-top: 24px;
    padding: 17px 0;
    border-top: 1px solid #2a2a2e;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #2a2a2e;
  }

  .project-result strong {
    flex-shrink: 0;
    color: #d5e2cc;
    font-size: 37px;
    font-weight: 550;
    line-height: 1;
    letter-spacing: -0.06em;
  }

  .project-result span {
    max-width: 310px;
    color: #a5a5ab;
    font-size: 12px;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .project-tags {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 7px;
    margin-top: 20px;
  }

  .project-tags span {
    padding: 5px 8px;
    border: 1px solid #303035;
    border-radius: 3px;
    color: #aaaab0;
    font-size: 11px;
  }

  .project-footer {
    margin-top: auto;
    padding-top: 28px;
    color: #77777e;
    font-size: 11px;
  }

  .project-note {
    margin: 14px 0 0;
    color: #77777e;
    font-size: 12px;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  .writing-section {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) auto;
    align-items: end;
    gap: 40px;
    margin-top: 96px;
    padding: 36px 0;
    border-top: 1px solid #29292d;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #29292d;
  }

  .writing-copy h2,
  .contact-section h2 {
    max-width: 620px;
    margin: 16px 0 12px;
    font-size: clamp(28px, 3.5vw, 39px);
    font-weight: 570;
    line-height: 1.15;
    letter-spacing: -0.05em;
  }

  .writing-copy > p,
  .contact-section > div > p {
    max-width: 620px;
    margin: 0;
    color: #a1a1a7;
    font-size: 14px;
    line-height: 1.85;
  }

  .writing-link {
    display: inline-flex;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 20px;
    padding: 12px 0;
    color: #e0e0e3;
    font-size: 13px;
  }

  .contact-section {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-end;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 36px;
    margin-top: 96px;
  }

  .contact-section h2 {
    margin-top: 16px;
  }

  .contact-actions {
    display: flex;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 12px;
    padding-bottom: 4px;
  }

  .contact-actions a {
    color: #bcbcc1;
    font-size: 13px;
  }

  .contact-actions a:hover {
    color: #fff;
  }

  @media (min-width: 1200px) {
    .hero-stage {
      min-height: 620px;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 850px) {
    .hero-stage {
      min-height: 510px;
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(0, 0.8fr);
    }

    .hero-content {
      width: 82%;
      padding: 30px;
    }

    h1 {
      font-size: clamp(43px, 6vw, 58px);
    }

    .hero-image {
      height: 450px;
    }

    .now-grid {
      gap: 22px;
    }

    .project {
      padding: 21px;
    }

    .project-featured {
      padding: 25px;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 600px) {
    .hero {
      padding-top: 28px;
    }

    .hero-eyebrow {
      gap: 7px;
      font-size: 10px;
      letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    }

    .hero-stage {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: stretch;
      min-height: 0;
      margin-top: 20px;
      padding: 0 0 10px;
    }

    .hero-image {
      order: 0;
      width: 100%;
      height: clamp(300px, 92vw, 430px);
    }

    .portrait {
      object-position: center 32%;
    }

    .image-caption {
      left: 14px;
      right: 14px;
      bottom: 13px;
      font-size: 9px;
    }

    .hero-content {
      order: 1;
      width: calc(100% - 20px);
      margin: -45px 0 0;
      padding: 25px 22px 23px;
      align-self: flex-start;
      background: rgba(15, 15, 17, 0.92);
      -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(18px);
      backdrop-filter: blur(18px);
    }

    .hero-kicker {
      margin-bottom: 17px;
      font-size: 10px;
    }

    h1 {
      font-size: clamp(39px, 10vw, 54px);
      line-height: 1.03;
    }

    .intro {
      margin-top: 19px;
      font-size: 16px;
      line-height: 1.7;
    }

    .hero-secondary {
      font-size: 13px;
    }

    .hero-actions {
      gap: 10px;
      margin-top: 23px;
    }

    .button-primary,
    .button-secondary {
      gap: 10px;
      padding-inline: 12px;
      font-size: 12px;
    }

    .hero-meta {
      gap: 7px;
      margin-top: 22px;
      font-size: 11px;
    }

    .now-section {
      margin-top: 25px;
      padding: 24px 0;
    }

    .now-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 23px;
      margin-top: 23px;
    }

    .now-item h2 {
      margin-top: 7px;
      font-size: 17px;
    }

    .now-item p {
      max-width: 440px;
      font-size: 13px;
    }

    .content-section,
    .writing-section,
    .contact-section {
      margin-top: 68px;
    }

    .section-heading {
      align-items: flex-end;
      gap: 12px;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }

    .section-title {
      font-size: 29px;
    }

    .section-link {
      font-size: 12px;
    }

    .projects {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 11px;
    }

    .project,
    .project-featured {
      grid-column: auto;
      padding: 22px;
    }

    .project h3 {
      margin-top: 19px;
      font-size: 20px;
    }

    .project p {
      font-size: 13px;
    }

    .project-footer {
      padding-top: 23px;
    }

    .writing-section {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 20px;
      padding: 27px 0;
    }

    .writing-copy h2,
    .contact-section h2 {
      font-size: 30px;
    }

    .writing-link {
      justify-self: start;
      padding: 4px 0;
    }

    .contact-section {
      align-items: flex-start;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 24px;
    }

    .contact-actions {
      flex-direction: row;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 18px;
    }
  }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .project,
    .project-arrow,
    .button-primary,
    .button-secondary {
      transition: none;
    }
  }
</style>
